{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：S03、S10—S12等较短段落里，X的感受提示层次偏多，连续扫读比Y的左右分栏更费眼，也容易顾着看字而漏掉音乐。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"平\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X用加亮短语标出人物每一步的心理落点，话与感受相邻，也有音乐节点上的同步提示，比较容易把听到的音乐变化和人物处境联系起来。Y虽然更容易一眼看到整体内容，但感受词与具体叙事节点的对应稍松；X则更清楚地呈现了从离开后的空落、反复怀念与挣扎，到最终不再为陪伴而委屈自己的连续变化，情绪细节也更具体、更有层次。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4947f801-8427-4be3-9753-6e6a8a53686f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T210545194291Z", "elapsed_seconds": 119.375, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T21:07:44.577008+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1f514d8648b6d235993f9cc8cea604a8b32c7ccec6373074b58f5a301805d8e3", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eed